cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this public pipeline is useful, cite the repository and the related preliminary work separately."
title: "Futsal Markerless Analysis"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-11-04
abstract: >-
  Developed by TeHealP@PUCP, this installable Python library and command-line
  tool implements lower-limb pose processing, camera-calibrated DLT
  reconstruction and futsal-kicking kinematics from the thesis methods. It
  records five trained DeepLabCut configurations and includes a synthetic
  end-to-end example. Trained checkpoint weights are not distributed.
